{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026yt5XoBgo0r1792710794.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>被軟禁的緬甸前國務資政昂山素姬，相隔五年獲准與次子阿里斯通電話。</p><p></p><p>81歲的昂山素姬在周四，與身處緬甸駐英大使館的阿里斯通話約20分鐘。阿里斯是昂山素姬與患癌病逝的英國丈夫的次子。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.MYAN.CALL-0200_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026i1A7YsjBo11792710792.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>他在社交平台發文稱聽到母親昂山素姬的聲音，勝過千言萬語。阿里斯接受傳媒訪問指母親似乎很健康，他擔心通話會被錄音，兩人僅談家事而不涉及敏感議題。阿里斯又稱跟母親通話，不代表緬甸當局批准探親。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.MYAN.CALL-0200_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026FyqeT0w73Y1792710789.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>2021年緬甸軍方發動政變，推翻昂山素姬領導的文人政府。法院裁定她煽動叛亂、貪腐等19項罪名成立，累計判監33年。今年4月，她由監獄轉到家中軟禁。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T00:19:48.750270+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":258,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T23:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T02:58:04.076028+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T00:17:58.972043+00:00","content_hash":"ab85863b7559ef771a4e8b152d96032374e7bf2dfd25e6f5785798ef13c53f68","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T00:19:48.750270+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}